[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15790.55, "timestamp": "04:23:10", "text": "我们心情无比愉悦。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15793.67, "timestamp": "04:23:13", "text": "珍·乔。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15796.55, "timestamp": "04:23:16", "text": "你的穿着打扮看起来不像本地人。你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15799.67, "timestamp": "04:23:19", "text": "一个四处游荡的旅行者？四处游荡的旅行者？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15803.51, "timestamp": "04:23:23", "text": "有人回家了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15806.56, "timestamp": "04:23:26", "text": "呃，我不记得了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15809.99, "timestamp": "04:23:29", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15813.59, "timestamp": "04:23:33", "text": "所以，你不知道自己为什么会在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15818.51, "timestamp": "04:23:38", "text": "你来自哪里，或者你是谁。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15821.67, "timestamp": "04:23:41", "text": "是的。所以，你没告诉我们你会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15826.229, "timestamp": "04:23:46", "text": "醒来后会出现这些后遗症。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15829.18, "timestamp": "04:23:49", "text": "嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15831.349, "timestamp": "04:23:51", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15834.07, "timestamp": "04:23:54", "text": "风给我们带来了警告。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15836.79, "timestamp": "04:23:56", "text": "阿特里克海正在汇聚。这似乎是一种新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15838.63, "timestamp": "04:23:58", "text": "酸性场正在形成。什么是"}]